  <Thumbnail>e9602c46-137e-4517-911a-eca35ebf9a0f</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="01-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (note gobo wheel 1 poor image quality and wheel 2 images cannot be added due to missing slot numbers in manual)" />
  <History Date="01-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Also note p/t speed, control (special) function requirements, spin directions, zoom calibration and prism macro ranges not properly documented - made best guess)" />
  <History Date="01-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo wheel 2 images (still poor quality but manual now has slot numbers)." />
  <History Date="01-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Note spin directions and zoom calibration are now documented and appear to be correct.  Still missing confirmation of P/T Speed and control requirements." />
